### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:
TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:
June 4, 2025
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-19-25 for furnishing Mid-Size SUVs and a Full Size SUV
for the City of Cheyenne (Solid Waste and Fleet Pool)
 ______________________________________________

Four (4) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Four (4) bids were received from:

1.
Fleet Vehicle Source, Inc dba US Fleet Source (Las Vegas, Nevada)
a.
Bid Rejected.  Did not comply with all Bid Requirement, and the Mid-Size SUV
Option did not meet the minimum wheelbase requirements.
2.
Fremont Motor Company (Lander, Wyoming)
3.
Ken Garff Cheyenne (Cheyenne, Wyoming)
4.
PFVT Motors, LLC dba Peoria Ford (Peoria, Arizona

The bids were reviewed by Bryan Bell (Fleet Maintenance), Craig LaVoy (Public Works), and
Vicki Nemecek (Public Works).

Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Fremont Motor Company.

The total requested bid award, less trade-ins, is for $141,587.00.

Funding:
023-14-1417-43-43102 (Solid Waste Fund / Equipment)

021-26-2615-40-43102 (1% Sales Tax 23-26 / Equipment)
```

